        "question": "Test the next cell in a jointly compatible set of color-corresponding cross-to-corner connections. Treat terrain availability, cardinal propagation and correspondence utility as revisable hypotheses; preserve every other marker and lateral separation. A local opening confirms only the point control, not the goal.",
